# PC card pc-melee-bank (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, Stage 2 result, BENCH-115): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 8 seeds (3183-3190, after Stage 2's 3177-3182), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: bankprep writes work/melee-bank-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, g4ef); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
